      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "Choose the nursery pot for the lowest price or if you already have a planter. Choose a decorative pot for a ready-to-display plant that arrives fully potted with soil mix, perlite and a drainage layer. The plant itself is the same."
     }
    },
    {
     "@type": "Question",
     "name": "Do the decorative pots have drainage holes?",
